    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Descend into Madness </h2>You are a private detective, drawn into the heart of a nightmare. A high-security prison, once a symbol of impenetrable justice, is now a macabre tableau of horror. A prisoner has vanished, leaving behind a trail of blood and a haunting silence.<br> <br>As you delve deeper into this labyrinth of despair, you'll uncover a truth far more sinister than any escape. This isn't just a prison; it's a grotesque experiment gone horribly wrong. The inmates? Subjects of twisted scientific horrors. The escape? A desperate bid for freedom from unimaginable torment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Features </h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> Immerse yourself in a chilling world of darkness and despair.<br></li><li><strong>Intense Exploration:</strong> Navigate through a labyrinthine prison filled with horrifying discoveries.<br></li><li><strong>Gruesome Puzzles:</strong> Unravel the mysteries of the experiments to progress.<br>Heart-Pounding Encounters: Face the horrific consequences of human experimentation.</li></ul>Can you escape the Horror Prison alive?",
